Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.07,0:02:02.25,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Dreamless dorm, ticking clock
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.02,0:02:07.24,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I walk away from the soundless room
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.27,0:02:12.19,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Windless night, moonlight melts
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.82,0:02:17.04,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}My ghostly 暗影 to the lukewarm gloom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:19.67,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Nightly dance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.79,0:02:24.44,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Of bleeding swords
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.69,0:02:29.51,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Reminds me that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.93,0:02:34.32,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I still live
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.14,0:02:43.48,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I will burn my dread
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:46.06,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I once ran away from the god of fear
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:48.83,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}And he chained me to despair
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.93,0:02:53.38,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Burn my dread
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:54.58,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I'll break the chain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:57.79,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}And run till I see the sunlight again
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.12,0:03:07.48,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I'll lift my face and run to the sunlight
