Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.60,0:09:54.27,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}I've never felt like thinking this will last forever
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.91,0:09:57.29,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Baby stay with me
