Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:23.33,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Feeling heart beat so close
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.44,0:10:25.19,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Will this last long?
